# Container-local path to the HTTP forward proxy's assigned Unix socket.
# Set this to a verified, absolute socket path before installing this file
# as /etc/op-dbus/identity-egress.env and enabling op-identity-egress.socket.
# The proxy must support HTTP requests and HTTPS CONNECT. A raw connection
# to the decoy, inbound Xray socket or network-manager control socket is
# not a forward proxy. No upstream is assigned by this example.
OP_EGRESS_UNIX_SOCKET=
